- TESTS: New manifest/provider privacy regressions cover host, account, path, address, and credential-like values. New teardown regressions cover delete failure, timeout, a still-present instance, and confirmed absence. The real loss-proxy test now accepts the platform-valid reset at connect time without weakening the required tenth-connection drop.

